s can easily become complicated, and the obvious explanation may turn out to be very disturbing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the rich, multilayered history of a fallen culture and the fate of those who encountered the unknown. Prepare for a series of difficult decisions, none of which may be the right one, and face the consequences that will affect your life and that of your entire crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646290/extras/aa0da709bb1443d03c38d0f43a19e71f.avif?t=1779626028\" width=680 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646290/extras/ce12d169e0371056fc357bad1891751d.avif?t=1779626028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646290/extras_big/ce12d169e0371056fc357bad1891751d.avif?t=1779626028 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The aim of the project is to reach international markets and increase the recognition of the game abroad, with co-funding of PLN 80,000.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The project Project: Aurora developed by Tesseract Games, is co-financed by European Funds for a Smart Economy 2021-2027 under the KPT ScaleUp Booster program.</i></p>", "short_description": "Aurora isn't as desolate as it seems. Survive amidst storms, lost technologies, and remnants of a vanished civilization—before you become part of them.Aurora is not as abandoned as it seems. As in classic sci-fi, discovering its secret means confronting the depths of cosmic horror.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646290/cbc089835fd7dea6afcb1e8007237b11ea263456/header.jpg?t=17796260